\description{
Returns the parts of the derivatives of the predictors that come from a
term whose block is recomputed at the coefficients (\code{\link[modelterms7:nl]{modelterms7::nl()}},
a smoothed \code{\link[modelterms7:seg]{modelterms7::seg()}}) in a model with a filter:
